note tsum: ts(n) = ts(n - 1) + n, ts(0) = 0, on ulong (Omega wraps unsigned values: no check). ts(1000000) is
note 500000500000 (Wolfram), i32 status 32; under omc the recursion is a million calls deep and traps 6 (exit 106).
fn ts n ulong to ulong
if lt n 1
ret n
end
r = ts sub n 1
ret add r n
end
fn main to int
ret int ts 1000000
end
